### Runtime document folders ###
# These are populated/rewritten by the Camel file-polling route at runtime
# (input/inprogress/.camel is Camel's own lock-tracking dir), not source.
# Keep the folders themselves out of git; only knowledgebase/ carries a
# small curated sample set that is intentionally tracked.
input/
archive/
failure/
